WEBVTT

00:18.373 --> 00:22.796
You want to go to college. You want to play

00:22.876 --> 00:28.099
pretend. This silly little game of yours, I know

00:28.159 --> 00:32.261
just how it ends. You think you're smart, my

00:32.441 --> 00:37.864
Aubrey. You think you'll get away. But I know how

00:37.904 --> 00:41.627
to break you. I know the words to say.

00:48.281 --> 00:56.913
It's the end So choose the stars, my little one,

00:56.953 --> 01:02.115
choose the great unknown A world of math you'll

01:02.255 --> 01:07.778
never pass out there all alone It's far too hard,

01:07.898 --> 01:11.820
it's far too cold, but trap, I've set for you This

01:11.920 --> 01:17.223
silly college experiment will be your Waterloo

01:21.325 --> 01:24.608
You'll fail your first assignment, you'll

01:24.748 --> 01:29.551
panic at the tests You'll realize you're not

01:29.612 --> 01:34.115
like them, you're not as good as them You'll see

01:34.175 --> 01:39.619
you're just a burden, incapable and weak You'll

01:39.719 --> 01:44.223
call me crying, begging you won't last a single

01:44.243 --> 01:44.583
week

01:47.581 --> 01:51.784
So choose the stars, my little one. Choose the

01:52.104 --> 01:56.948
great unknown. A world of math you'll never pass

01:57.288 --> 02:02.391
out there all alone. It's far too hard. It's far

02:02.431 --> 02:07.935
too cold a trap I set for you. This silly college

02:07.975 --> 02:11.898
experiment will be your Waterloo.

02:23.995 --> 02:29.881
Run along, play your game It's all part of the

02:29.961 --> 02:31.842
plan

02:34.465 --> 02:39.790
You'll come back home You'll come back to me They

02:39.930 --> 02:41.892
always come back to me

02:47.571 --> 02:51.775
So choose the stars, my little one Choose the

02:52.115 --> 02:56.939
great unknown A world of math you'll never pass

02:57.420 --> 03:02.404
out there all alone It's far too hard, it's far

03:02.444 --> 03:07.948
too cold A trap I set for you This silly college

03:08.089 --> 03:11.832
experiment will be your Waterloo

03:13.854 --> 03:15.035
You'll come home

03:19.797 --> 03:20.998
You'll fail

03:25.863 --> 03:27.045
You'll come home

